{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Rd3jHjAB4L1795420294.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>Sierra Sea本月暫錄約32宗成交，交投氣氛暢旺。美聯物業馬鞍山聯席區域經理區祺彬（Kenny Au）表示，該行最新促成Sierra Sea 2A期一個299實呎單位成交，獲新盤向隅客以486.8萬元承接。<br/>區祺彬表示，成交單位為Sierra Sea 2A期3座低層J室，實用面積約299平方呎。據了解，買家為新盤向隅客，購入單位作自用，以486.8萬元承接單位，折合實用呎價約16,281元。<br/>資料顯示，原業主於2026年1月以約374.3萬元購入上述物業，持貨約10個月，帳面獲利約112.5萬元，升值約30.1%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:03:53.523522+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T09:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:57:18.598217+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T09:57:16.437514+00:00","content_hash":"a7b119c6c1c2509e6d0eb738ba283d5b8e0ea1eb272335362a0b7fffff2a205f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T10:03:53.523522+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}